text:
Boiler not heating {pill}
  Is the thermostat calling? | 24 VAC across R and W at the boiler
    [No] Fix the thermostat circuit | batteries, setpoint, wiring {gray}
    [Yes] Is the circulator running? | warm pump body, faint hum
      [No] Check the circulator | relay, capacitor, stuck impeller {red}
      [Yes] Does the burner light? | listen for ignition
        [No] Lockout or no spark? | read the control's status code
          [Lockout] Reset once | if it locks out again, call for service {red}
          [No spark] Check igniter and flame sensor | clean the sensor rod {orange}
        [Yes] Pressure 12–15 psi when cold? | boiler gauge
          [Low] Find the leak, check the fill valve {orange}
          [OK] Bleed air from the zones | top-floor radiators first {green}
